Package: okranger
Type: Package
Title: Random Forests for RKHS-Valued Responses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Luca", "Bergen", email = "bergen@leibniz-bips.de", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Implements output kernel random forests (OKRFs) for regression with
    responses taking values in a reproducing kernel Hilbert space (RKHS). 
    Training responses can be supplied either as an explicit feature matrix or
    as a Gram matrix. Uses an approximate feature representation for split 
    selection and C++ code for computationally efficient training. Builds on the 
    'ranger' R package.
License: GPL-3
Imports: Rcpp (>= 0.11.2), Matrix
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
Depends: R (>= 3.1)
Suggests: 
    survival,
    testthat
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/lucabergen/okranger
BugReports: https://github.com/lucabergen/okranger/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
